Note, however, that the very newest Ultra2 LVD cards are not
backwards compatible with previous SCSI devices.  (LVD is Low Voltage
Differential.)  That's why some vendors are shipping systems with 2
SCSI cards, one Ultra2 and one Ultra (which is backwards compatible).

-andy



