with RH 5.1 didn't work, so I found it easier to boot directly from the CD.

    1. format an ms-dos disk for milo.  Copy (using dos copy) the avanti milo and
linloader to the first disk.  The milo and linloader on the RH disk worked for
me.

    boot dva0

    2. once in MILO, I booted the install directly from the CD

    MILO> boot -t iso9660 scd0:kernels/xl.gz root=/dev/scd0

    The install program will run from there.

