Very good card, well supported under XFree86.  One of the fastest
video cards under XFree86.

>2. Riva TNT /16MB PCI

No experience with this card.  AFAIK it is supported, but check on
www.xfree86.org before buying.  I believe (but I could be wrong) that
the Mill2 has better 2D performance.  But at the level we're talking
about here, a few more XMarks aren't going to make a bit of
