No way Jos�.  The whole point is to move bunches of files from the
future back to the past without messing up the order of their time
stamps relative to one another.  If you care about versioning,
makefiles or just want to know "which version of that project is the
most recent?", it's best not to throw away all timestamp information
with 'touch'.  IMHO.

Bye,
  Rob.



