There are a number of options...

There appears to be a version of mozilla that someone has put together;
but as in all current mozilla code, it is flaky.

If you have access to a Digital UNIX system, it is possible to take
appropriate shared libraries and the loader across to Alpha Linux and
run it; I've never done it, so don't have much to say about this option.

