Brossier Sebastien jean elie wrote:
> 
> I tried to compile the kernel 2.1.125, but when I type: make vmlinux ,
> after some lines, compilation stops, saying that, in dma.c ,
> SPIN_LOCK_UNLOCK is undefined.
> Please help!
