The 2.1.X kernels now have smp (multi processor) support by default.
This does not quite work yet on the alpha.  Edit the top level makefile
and comment out the SMP=1 line.  Note, you must comment it out, setting
it to SMP=0 will not help.

After doing that I was able to compile fine.

- Doug



