I had the same problem after I installed the additional 16M from
WebAuction. It turns out that their SIMMs are not usable in the
AS200. Remove these 2 SIMMs and you should be Ok with the ones from
DEC--assuming your AS200 is from WebAuction as well. ARC won't boot
with only 16M, but SRM will and you should be able to complete your
installation, including X.

Good luck,

