My Multia came with an almost dead battery, and I've heard from others that
have had the same problem.  The fact that you can disconnect it, reconnect
it and get a boot indicates that you've got a little voltage left but it
fades as it is used.

Please note that Multia/166 boxes sold on Onsale were built in 1994-96 and
have probably been sitting in a warehouse for a couple of years. When the
battery is connected to hardware and sitting in a hot/cold warehouse the
shelf life isn't very long...

