Don't feel bad, this is a very common problem. The first disk, with
MILO and loadlin.exe should be FAT. Don't use rawrite to put
the files on there, just copy them. You see ARC only understands
2 filesystems, FAT and NTFS, so if you rawrite these two it doesn't
understand. However the next 2 floppies should be done with rawrite.
Most install docs leave this part out!!!!

