: display.
:           The card has 2mb memory so it should display over 256colors.
The problem is in the compilation of the RH5.0 packages and kernel using
egcs. Egcs uses other optimizations which broke some assumptions and so the
X server gets wrong values when asking the kernel.
The solution is to use later XFree packages from RedHat, I use
XFree-3.3.2-13 now which happily does the job.
CU
